## Telemetry Health Monitoring

The first dashboard capability provides visibility into systems currently reporting telemetry.

### Reporting Hosts

```spl
index=*
| stats count as events latest(_time) as last_event by host
| convert ctime(last_event)
| sort host
```

This provides:

- Reporting host
- Event volume
- Most recent event

---

## Telemetry Status

A basic ingestion-health classification was implemented using:

```spl
index=*
| stats latest(_time) as last_event by host
| eval age_seconds=now()-last_event
| eval status=case(
age_seconds<=300,"HEALTHY",
age_seconds<=900,"DELAYED",
true(),"STALE")
| convert ctime(last_event)
| table host last_event status
| sort host
```

Lab-defined thresholds:

| Event Age | Status |
|---|---|
| ≤ 5 minutes | HEALTHY |
| 5–15 minutes | DELAYED |
| > 15 minutes | STALE |

These thresholds are intended for lab operational visibility and do not represent universal production standards.

