## Windows Security Telemetry Monitoring

The dashboard monitors several security-relevant Windows Event IDs:

| Event ID | Description |
|---:|---|
| 4624 | Successful Logon |
| 4625 | Failed Logon |
| 4104 | PowerShell Script Block Logging |
| 4698 | Scheduled Task Creation |
| 4728 | Security-Enabled Global Group Membership Change |

Telemetry volume can be reviewed using:

```spl
index=* (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4625 OR EventCode=4104 OR EventCode=4698 OR EventCode=4728)
| eval telemetry=case(
EventCode=4624,"Successful Logon",
EventCode=4625,"Failed Logon",
EventCode=4104,"PowerShell",
EventCode=4698,"Scheduled Task",
EventCode=4728,"Group Membership Change",
true(),"Other")
| stats count by EventCode telemetry
| sort EventCode
```

