## Remote Network Authentication

Remote network authentication monitoring uses the previously tuned network-logon methodology:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4624 LogonType=3
| where IpAddress!="-" AND IpAddress!="127.0.0.1" AND IpAddress!="::1"
| stats count as network_logons by TargetUserName IpAddress
| sort - network_logons
```

This provides visibility into:

- Target accounts
- Remote source addresses
- Network authentication volume

