## Privileged Group Monitoring

Security-enabled global group membership changes are monitored using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728
| sort - _time
| table _time host SubjectUserName MemberName GroupName
```

Domain Admin-related activity can be isolated using:

```spl
index=* EventCode=4728 "Domain Admins"
| sort - _time
| table _time host SubjectUserName MemberName GroupName
```

