## Detection-Relevant Event Activity

The dashboard provides visibility into telemetry associated with existing detection logic.

```spl
index=* ((EventCode=4625) OR (EventCode=4104) OR (EventCode=4698) OR (EventCode=4728) OR (EventCode=4624 AND LogonType=3))
| eval detection=case(
EventCode=4625,"DET-002",
EventCode=4104,"DET-003",
EventCode=4698,"DET-004",
EventCode=4728,"DET-005",
EventCode=4624 AND LogonType=3 AND IpAddress!="-" AND IpAddress!="127.0.0.1" AND IpAddress!="::1","DET-006",
true(),"Other")
| where detection!="Other"
| stats count as matching_events by detection
| sort detection
```

### Important Distinction

This panel represents:

```text
Events matching detection-relevant behavior
```

It does **not** represent:

```text
Actual alert trigger count
```

This distinction prevents the dashboard from overstating detection activity.

