## MITRE ATT&CK Coverage

A static coverage inventory was incorporated into the dashboard.

```spl
| makeresults
| eval coverage="DET-001|Discovery|T1046;DET-002|Credential Access|T1110;DET-003|Execution|T1059.001;DET-004|Persistence|T1053.005;DET-005|Privilege Escalation / Persistence|T1098.007;DET-006|Lateral Movement|T1021;CORR-001|Multi-Stage|Multiple;CORR-002|Lateral Movement + Execution|T1021 + T1059.001"
| makemv delim=";" coverage
| mvexpand coverage
| rex field=coverage "(?<analytic>[^|]+)\|(?<tactic>[^|]+)\|(?<technique>.+)"
| table analytic tactic technique
```

The panel provides an analyst-facing overview of the ATT&CK coverage represented by the lab's detection engineering work.

