## Host Activity Monitoring

Security-event volume by endpoint is displayed using:

```spl
index=* (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4625 OR EventCode=4104 OR EventCode=4698 OR EventCode=4728)
| stats count as security_events by host
| sort - security_events
```

Telemetry diversity is monitored using:

```spl
index=* (EventCode=4624 OR EventCode=4625 OR EventCode=4104 OR EventCode=4698 OR EventCode=4728)
| stats dc(EventCode) as event_types values(EventCode) as observed_event_codes by host
| sort - event_types
```

This provides visibility into both event volume and the variety of security telemetry received from individual endpoints.

