## Dashboard Limitations

SOC-OPS-001 has several documented limitations:

1. Detection-relevant event counts do not represent actual alert-trigger counts.
2. An EventCode that does not appear may represent either no activity or missing telemetry.
3. Event IDs 4625 and 4698 have demonstrated inconsistent historical availability in the lab.
4. The dashboard only evaluates telemetry received by Splunk.
5. The dashboard does not independently validate endpoint audit configuration.
6. HEALTHY, DELAYED, and STALE thresholds are lab-defined operational thresholds.
7. MITRE ATT&CK coverage is an inventory of implemented analytics rather than dynamically generated ATT&CK coverage.

